      "text": "[LW22] J. Lu and L. Wang (2022) On explicit L^{2} -convergence rate estimate for piecewise deterministic Markov processes in MCMC algorithms . Ann. Appl. Probab. 32 ( 2 ), pp. 1333–1361 . Cited by: §B.1 , §1 , §3.3 ."
    }
  ],
